wine-sg (10.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: Wine 10.0 built with --enable-archs=i386,x86_64.
  * Carries four fixes from Debian's wine packaging; see patches/series.
    binutils2.44.patch is required -- without it the build produces PE files
    whose import address tables land in read-only sections, and every process
    faults during module load on Debian trixie.

